#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/single-use-values.md:6
msgid "Single-use values"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/single-use-values.md:8
msgid ""
"Sometimes we want values that _can only be used once_. One critical example "
"of this is in cryptography: A \"Nonce.\""
msgstr ""

